Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you rent your card\Nmachine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,there's a rule you should\Nknow about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Since January 2023,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,the payments regulator\Nsays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,a terminal lease can only\Ntie you in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,for 18 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not three years, not four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,When those 18 months are\Nup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:19.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,the big providers have to\Nwrite and tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,The letter gives the date
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,your minimum term ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:23.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,and that you're free to\Nswitch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,to another card machine\Nprovider.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:27.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you choose to stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,you can still leave at any\Ntime after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:32.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,as long as you give them\None month's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:34.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some deals are fine as\Nthey are,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,but you won't know until\Nyou compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comparing terminal rates\Nis easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,it doesn't take long,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:41.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the difference between\Nproviders
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:43.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,adds up over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:44.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here at NeroPay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:46.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,you can get a quote in\Nminutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Drop us a message or give\Nus a call
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:50.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,and speak to someone from\Nour team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's it for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:52.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,give us a follow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,to keep up with more\Nvideos like this.
